  "question": {
    "text": "<p>An ideal gas in a closed container is slowly heated. As its temperature increases, which of the following statements are true ?&nbsp;</p><p>(A) the mean free path of the molecules decreases</p><p>(B) the mean collision time between the molecules decreases.</p><p>(C) the mean free path remains unchanged.</p><p>(D) the mean collision time relations unchanged.</p>",
    "image": null
  },
